{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>五中全會結束　增選張升民為政治局委員 中國共產黨第二十屆中央委員會第五次全體會議周四（29日）結束並且發表會議公告，全會增選中央軍委副主席張升民為中央政治局委員。全會決定，中國共產黨第二十一次全國代表大會於2027年下半年在北京召開。&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;全會按照黨章規定，決定遞補中央委員會候補</strong></p><p>暫時未能從來源擷取全文或 RSS 摘要。</p><p><a href=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261029/bkn-20261029173300866-1029_00822_001.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">閱讀原文</a></p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T10:01:24.336923+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":173,"images":0,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"minimal","origin":"minimal","completeness":"insufficient","text_status":"title-only"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T09:33:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T09:58:19.867159+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T09:58:19.867159+00:00","content_hash":"23749f595ec8b8e202f6b63bd75f21c05a8379426b58e714f5af41ef5effa7c2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}